{
  "contract": "AC1 (#502) redaction calibration corpus. Every entry is labeled with a kind and an expected outcome. 'benign' entries must pass through redact_secret_like_text byte-identical (verifiable-identifier contexts: release/commit/md5:/sha256:/object labels, version strings, short hex ids, credential-free URLs). 'credential' entries must be redacted (detection_count >= 1, text changed, credential_value substring absent from the output). The unlabeled-hex-run entry pins the fail-safe net: a 32+ hex run with NO verifiable-identifier context stays redacted.",
